{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Healthcare Development Automation",
  "description": "Automates documentation generation, unit testing, compliance validation, audit logging, and rule engine rebuilds for the prior authorization healthcare system",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileCreated",
    "patterns": [
      "**/*.py",
      "tests/**/*.py",
      "scripts/**/*.py",
      "config/**/*.json",
      "config/**/*.yaml",
      "docs/**/*.md"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "A file has been modified in the healthcare prior authorization system. Please perform the following automated tasks based on the file change:\n\n1. **On Python file save**: \n   - Generate documentation by running: python scripts/generate_docs.py\n   - Execute unit tests by running: pytest tests/\n   \n2. **On task completion**:\n   - Validate HIPAA compliance by running: python scripts/check_hipaa_compliance.py  \n   - Update audit log by running: python scripts/update_audit_log.py\n\n3. **On any file change**:\n   - Rebuild rule engine by running: python scripts/rebuild_rules.py\n\nEnsure all operations maintain HIPAA compliance and generate appropriate audit trails. Focus on healthcare-specific validation and maintain traceability for all authorization decisions."
  }
}